--------------------------------------------------------------------------
External data services (not bundled, called at runtime only)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Open Food Facts, https://world.openfoodfacts.org/
   Optional product enrichment is requested by the browser directly from the
   Open Food Facts API when the user enables it. Product data is made
   available by Open Food Facts under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
   The app displays the attribution "Open Food Facts (ODbL)" next to any
   product data it shows. No Open Food Facts data is redistributed with this
   repository.
